    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The international RPG Maker MV version of the Brazilian's RPG Maker 2003 classic:<br><strong>Fantasya Final Definitiva REMAKE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Samuka, a former noble and skilled samurai from Kaganumato Island, ventures through the world indefinitely after a pub to drink out his misadventures without knowing that the future of Earth, and even the good sake of Time-Space continuum, lays at his hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Later, a stray dog, an orphaned martian and a madhouse escapee join his party to journey alongside him through the past and the future on this epic nonsense adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Definitive Fantasy\u00a0</strong>is both a parody to shabby made RPG Maker games and homage to old classics of the J-RPG genre.</p>",
